    {
      "title": "有 $xy$ 項：用乘法法則",
      "prompt": "$xy + y^2 = 6$，求 $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ 在 $(1, 2)$",
      "problemId": "tb-imp-002",
      "steps": [
        "確認：$1 \\cdot 2 + 2^2 = 6$，點在曲線上。",
        "微分：$(xy)' = y + x y'$，$(y^2)' = 2y y'$，$(6)' = 0$。得 $y + x y' + 2y y' = 0$。",
        "含 $y'$ 的放一邊：$y'(x + 2y) = -y$，所以 $y' = -\\frac{y}{x + 2y}$。",
        "代 $(1, 2)$：$y' = -\\frac{2}{1 + 4} = -\\frac{2}{5}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$-\\frac{2}{5}$",
      "note": "這條曲線其實解得出 $y = \\frac{-x + \\sqrt{x^2 + 24}}{2}$（取經過 $(1, 2)$ 的那一支），直接微分也得 $-\\frac{2}{5}$。",
      "claim": "D((-x+sqrt(x^2+24))/2, 1) == -2/5"
    },
    {
      "title": "解不出 $y$ 的曲線",
      "prompt": "$x^3 + y^3 = 6xy$，求 $\\frac{dy}{dx}$ 在 $(3, 3)$",
      "problemId": "cx-app-002",
      "steps": [
        "確認：$27 + 27 = 54 = 6 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 3$，點在曲線上。",
        "微分：$3x^2 + 3y^2 y' = 6y + 6x y'$（右邊 $6xy$ 用乘法法則）。",
        "整理：$y'(3y^2 - 6x) = 6y - 3x^2$，同除以 3：$y' = \\frac{2y - x^2}{y^2 - 2x}$。",
        "代 $(3, 3)$：$y' = \\frac{6 - 9}{9 - 6} = -1$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$-1$",
      "note": "驗算用的是這條曲線的參數式 $x = \\frac{6t}{1 + t^3}$、$y = \\frac{6t^2}{1 + t^3}$，$t = 1$ 正好是 $(3, 3)$，斜率 $= \\left(\\frac{dy}{dt}\\right)/\\left(\\frac{dx}{dt}\\right)$。",
      "claim": "D(6t^2/(1+t^3), 1)/D(6t/(1+t^3), 1) == -1"
    }
